    "detailed_description": "Welcome to a game where randomly generated dungeons are more like an IKEA maze, and your enemies and allies are so ridiculous they could be a lesson in how not to make a game. Armed with a rusty sword and dubious magic, you'll be dying endlessly, facing monsters whose biggest threat is the spelling of their names. With every step, your tragic fame will grow, and so will your ability to find even sillier ways to meet your end<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Epic Battles You\u2019ll Never Forget</h2>Tired of spamming the same overpowered skill in turn-based RPGs? Or maybe you\u2019re searching for a new monitor after another round of \u201cfair\u201d randomness in a card duel? We\u2019ve mixed it all into one insane cocktail so you can simultaneously rage against the randomness, count your moves, and rack your brain trying to save the last surviving hero from a horde of goblins<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090960/extras/0e4e4fa551e0f903fd70559cde0548b8.poster.avif?t=1732859963\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090960/extras/0e4e4fa551e0f903fd70559cde0548b8.webm?t=1732859963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090960/extras/0e4e4fa551e0f903fd70559cde0548b8.mp4?t=1732859963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Skill Cards for Genius Combos</h2>Forget about boring, pre-set skill sets from other games\u2014here, you'll get fireballs when you\u2019re begging for shield and lightning instead of healing. Building and perfecting the ideal deck for each hero will be more than just part of the game; it'll be a real pain and a fight for survival. Combine skills like your life depends on it, so your mage can screw enemies without getting screwed over!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090960/extras/e6393156190596286c57006e1afd49c5.poster.avif?t=1732859963\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090960/extras/e6393156190596286c57006e1afd49c5.webm?t=1732859963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090960/extras/e6393156190596286c57006e1afd49c5.mp4?t=1732859963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dungeons and Their Odd Inhabitants</h2>Procedurally generated dungeons aren\u2019t just a random set of corridors. They\u2019re hellish mazes packed with hundreds of enemies, traps, and weird characters ready to discuss everything except your inevitable death<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090960/extras/e43d7e78b07970f5bf38111106227a6f.poster.avif?t=1732859963\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090960/extras/e43d7e78b07970f5bf38111106227a6f.webm?t=1732859963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090960/extras/e43d7e78b07970f5bf38111106227a6f.mp4?t=1732859963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Heroes Lives Matters</h2>Assemble a motley crew of heroes, each with unique talents and quirks, and head out to face new defeats. Permanent death ensures that your heroes will change often, and every decision will weigh as much as the last bottle of rum on a sinking ship!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090960/extras/b24579711f1ddf2d627abc00910f89db.poster.avif?t=1732859963\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090960/extras/b24579711f1ddf2d627abc00910f89db.webm?t=1732859963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090960/extras/b24579711f1ddf2d627abc00910f89db.mp4?t=1732859963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Moral Systems</h2>Almost every decision you make determines whether your heroes become champions of light or sinister villains\u2014and it's not just for show off. Your choices will affect their skills and abilities. We simply decided to add another feature to make your life harder! Plus, the publisher said it might boost sales...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customizable Difficulty Levels</h2>When our sales manager finally stopped crying, he said it was inhumane to torture players like that. We added fine-tuned difficulty settings so hardcore maniacs and newbies alike can find their perfect dose of adrenaline",
    "about_the_game": "Welcome to a game where randomly generated dungeons are more like an IKEA maze, and your enemies and allies are so ridiculous they could be a lesson in how not to make a game. Armed with a rusty sword and dubious magic, you'll be dying endlessly, facing monsters whose biggest threat is the spelling of their names. With every step, your tragic fame will grow, and so will your ability to find even sillier ways to meet your end<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Epic Battles You\u2019ll Never Forget</h2>Tired of spamming the same overpowered skill in turn-based RPGs? Or maybe you\u2019re searching for a new monitor after another round of \u201cfair\u201d randomness in a card duel? We\u2019ve mixed it all into one insane cocktail so you can simultaneously rage against the randomness, count your moves, and rack your brain trying to save the last surviving hero from a horde of goblins<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090960/extras/0e4e4fa551e0f903fd70559cde0548b8.poster.avif?t=1732859963\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090960/extras/0e4e4fa551e0f903fd70559cde0548b8.webm?t=1732859963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090960/extras/0e4e4fa551e0f903fd70559cde0548b8.mp4?t=1732859963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Skill Cards for Genius Combos</h2>Forget about boring, pre-set skill sets from other games\u2014here, you'll get fireballs when you\u2019re begging for shield and lightning instead of healing. Building and perfecting the ideal deck for each hero will be more than just part of the game; it'll be a real pain and a fight for survival. Combine skills like your life depends on it, so your mage can screw enemies without getting screwed over!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video clas