kamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090960/extras/b24579711f1ddf2d627abc00910f89db.webm?t=1732859963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2090960/extras/b24579711f1ddf2d627abc00910f89db.mp4?t=1732859963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Moral Systems</h2>Almost every decision you make determines whether your heroes become champions of light or sinister villains\u2014and it's not just for show off. Your choices will affect their skills and abilities. We simply decided to add another feature to make your life harder! Plus, the publisher said it might boost sales...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customizable Difficulty Levels</h2>When our sales manager finally stopped crying, he said it was inhumane to torture players like that. We added fine-tuned difficulty settings so hardcore maniacs and newbies alike can find their perfect dose of adrenaline",
    "short_description": "Welcome to the rogue-like with a unique combat system mixing the depth of turn-based RPGs with the thrill of poker, where your mission is to lose with style! Gather heroes, craft perfect skill combos, and navigate randomly generated dungeons where your boldest plans end in hilariously epic fails",
